msgctxt "title"
msgid "2027 Call for applications"
msgstr "Appel à candidatures pour 2027"

msgctxt "hero_title"
msgid "Imagining a future worth building"
msgstr "Imaginer un avenir qui mérite d’être construit"

msgctxt "hero_description"
msgid "Be a part of Mozilla Foundation's next Fellowship cohort."
msgstr "Rejoignez la prochaine promotion du programme de bourses de la Fondation Mozilla."

msgctxt "hero_image_alt_text"
msgid "Fellow writing on post-it notes"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "hero_cta_link.3cc383f4-b9e4-4c11-a4b7-a638a9334244.label"
msgid "Submit your Letter of Intent"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.dcd0d234-118c-407f-81ee-7013fd2d2bc1"
msgid "Mozilla Foundation will award 10 Fellowships for the 2027-2028 period."
msgstr "La Fondation Mozilla attribuera 10 bourses pour la période 2027- 2028."

msgctxt "body.dcd0d234-118c-407f-81ee-7013fd2d2bc1"
msgid ""
"We are looking for extraordinary individuals working at the edges of human imagination, on technology that's too early, too unexpected, or too ambitious for anyone else to fund. Our Fellows are "
"<b>builders first</b>, of tools and of the fields around them. But they are also defiant about who technology should serve, and rigorous about making it a reality."
msgstr ""
"Nous recherchons des personnes hors du commun qui repoussent les limites de l’imagination humaine en développant des technologies trop précoces, trop inattendues ou trop ambitieuses pour trouver des"
" financements ailleurs. Nos boursiers sont <b>avant tout des bâtisseurs</b> : ils conçoivent des outils et contribuent à façonner les domaines qui les entourent. Mais ils défendent aussi avec "
"détermination l’idée que la technologie doit être au service de tous, et s’attachent avec rigueur à faire de cette vision une réalité."

msgctxt "body.dcd0d234-118c-407f-81ee-7013fd2d2bc1"
msgid ""
"If that sounds like you, come build with us. Bring the wildest, most radical version of your idea: the one that questions who gets to decide and puts control back in the hands of the people who use "
"it. Optimizing the status quo is somebody else's job. Ours is to build the alternatives."
msgstr ""
"Si vous vous reconnaissez dans cette description, rejoignez-nous pour construire ensemble. Apportez-nous la version la plus audacieuse et la plus radicale de votre idée : celle qui remet en question"
" le pouvoir décisionnel et redonne le contrôle aux utilisateurs. Optimiser le statu quo, c’est le travail de quelqu’un d’autre. Le nôtre, c’est de construire des alternatives."

msgctxt "body.919eb936-172d-4da3-8d43-1d29cf27498d.label"
msgid "Meet the 2026 Fellows"
msgstr "Découvrez les boursiers 2026"

msgctxt "body.cbdd2cb1-e1ba-4b61-88a5-626462d0b92d.left_column.4ed60931-4a65-4083-96ca-205e459d4040"
msgid "This year's focus areas"
msgstr "Les thématiques de cette année"

msgctxt "body.cbdd2cb1-e1ba-4b61-88a5-626462d0b92d.left_column.4ed60931-4a65-4083-96ca-205e459d4040"
msgid ""
"This cohort is for people reimagining emerging technology while its future is still being decided. Some are building what moves us forward. Others are building the safeguards that keep us human. If "
"you’re doing either, we want to hear from you. For more information about these focus areas, please check out <a id=\"a1\">the full request for proposals</a>."
msgstr ""
"Cette cohorte s’adresse à ceux qui repensent les technologies émergentes alors que leur avenir reste encore à définir. Certains développent des solutions qui nous font avancer. D’autres mettent en "
"place les garde-fous qui nous permettent de rester humains. Si vous faites partie de l’un ou l’autre de ces groupes, n’hésitez pas à nous contacter. Pour plus d’informations sur ces thématiques "
"prioritaires, veuillez consulter <a id=\"a1\">l’appel à candidatures complet</a>."

msgctxt "body.cbdd2cb1-e1ba-4b61-88a5-626462d0b92d.left_column.4ed60931-4a65-4083-96ca-205e459d4040"
msgid ""
"<b>Neurotech, biotech, and physical AI.</b> Technology is moving off the screen and into our brains, bodies, and land, and we’re backing people who make sure the communities it touches get to own, "
"shape, and govern it."
msgstr ""
"<b>Neurotechnologie, biotechnologie et IA physique.</b> La technologie quitte les écrans pour s’immiscer dans nos cerveaux, nos corps et nos territoires. Nous soutenons celles et ceux qui veillent à"
" ce que les communautés concernées puissent se l’approprier, la façonner et en définir les règles de gouvernance."

msgctxt "body.cbdd2cb1-e1ba-4b61-88a5-626462d0b92d.left_column.4ed60931-4a65-4083-96ca-205e459d4040"
msgid ""
"<b>Hard infrastructure: compute, energy, quantum, and the extremes.</b> The infrastructure that will define the next decade is being built in orbit, on the seabed, in data centers, and inside "
"quantum machines, mostly behind closed doors, and we’re backing the people opening it up so communities get the data, the tools, and a vote."
msgstr ""
"<b>Infrastructures physiques : informatique, énergie, informatique quantique et conditions extrêmes.</b> Les infrastructures qui façonneront la prochaine décennie se construisent en orbite, au fond "
"des océans, dans les centres de données et au cœur des ordinateurs quantiques, le plus souvent à huis clos. Nous soutenons celles et ceux qui œuvrent à les rendre plus accessibles, afin que les "
"communautés disposent des données, des outils et d’un véritable pouvoir de décision."

msgctxt "body.cbdd2cb1-e1ba-4b61-88a5-626462d0b92d.left_column.4ed60931-4a65-4083-96ca-205e459d4040"
msgid ""
"<b>Raising</b> <b>p(bloom).</b> Instead of obsessing over the odds that AI goes wrong, we’re funding people who raise the odds it goes right, building AI that makes life better for far more people "
"and breaking up the gatekeeping that hides behind the word “safety.”"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.cbdd2cb1-e1ba-4b61-88a5-626462d0b92d.left_column.4ed60931-4a65-4083-96ca-205e459d4040"
msgid ""
"<b>Business models for a post-agentic web.</b> The web’s old bargain of free information in exchange for our attention is collapsing under agents and paywalls, and we’re funding the people building "
"the new deal, so creators, communities, and the open web still get paid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.cbdd2cb1-e1ba-4b61-88a5-626462d0b92d.left_column.4ed60931-4a65-4083-96ca-205e459d4040"
msgid ""
"<b>Shared security and audit infrastructure for small organizations.</b> We want to make security work like a public library rather than a pricey consultancy, giving small organizations affordable "
"ways to test, audit, and trust the technology they depend on. Startups and emerging organizations shouldn't have to break the bank to ensure their tools and products are safe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.cbdd2cb1-e1ba-4b61-88a5-626462d0b92d.left_column.4ed60931-4a65-4083-96ca-205e459d4040"
msgid ""
"<b>Sovereign AI, public infrastructure, and maintenance.</b> Communities shouldn’t have to rent their intelligence from a distant cloud, so we’re funding AI and infrastructure people can own, run, "
"and keep running long after the company behind it is gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.cbdd2cb1-e1ba-4b61-88a5-626462d0b92d.left_column.4ed60931-4a65-4083-96ca-205e459d4040"
msgid ""
"<b>Creative advocacy (one Fellow).</b> One reserved Independent Fellowship spot will go to a culture jammer, prankster, or artist-provocateur who can turn a stunt into a movement and make people "
"rethink who technology is built for."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.cbdd2cb1-e1ba-4b61-88a5-626462d0b92d.left_column.4ed60931-4a65-4083-96ca-205e459d4040"
msgid ""
"<i>If your work doesn't fit any of these, apply as a</i> <b><i>Wildcard</i></b><i>. Some of our best Fellows arrived with an idea we hadn't thought to ask for. If nobody else will fund it yet, "
"that's usually a good sign. Come build with us.</i>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.18f89475-52a5-472c-a915-059f5049a039"
msgid "How to apply"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.18f89475-52a5-472c-a915-059f5049a039"
msgid ""
"Applications are reviewed through a multi-stage process. The primary review occurs at the <b>Letter of Intent</b> stage, with only a small number of shortlisted applicants invited to submit a full "
"application in early 2027."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.18f89475-52a5-472c-a915-059f5049a039"
msgid "<b>Letter of Intent deadline:</b> Dec. 17, 2026, at 11:59 p.m. PST (UTC-8)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.18f89475-52a5-472c-a915-059f5049a039"
msgid "<b>Invitation to submit full application:</b> Feb. 16, 2027"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.18f89475-52a5-472c-a915-059f5049a039"
msgid "<b>Full application deadline:</b> March 12, 2027, at 11:59 p.m. PST (UTC-8)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.18f89475-52a5-472c-a915-059f5049a039"
msgid "<b>Final applicants notified:</b> April 30, 2027"
msgstr "<b>Notification des candidats retenus :</b> 30 avril 2027."

msgctxt "body.18f89475-52a5-472c-a915-059f5049a039"
msgid "The Fellowship begins on June 1, 2027, and runs for 12 months."
msgstr "Le programme de bourses débute le 1er juin 2027 et dure 12 mois."

msgctxt "body.18f89475-52a5-472c-a915-059f5049a039"
msgid "Before applying, we recommend that you <a id=\"a1\">read the full request for proposals</a> for more details about our key focus areas and host organizations."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.649ca71f-12cb-4389-9e2f-fb159ddcd598.label"
msgid "Submit your Letter of Intent"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.a11bfa04-7d08-450c-a168-403db154acb6"
msgid "How to nominate a potential Fellow"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.a11bfa04-7d08-450c-a168-403db154acb6"
msgid "Anyone can apply directly. Nominations are an extra route: nominees who meet the eligibility criteria will be contacted with details on how to submit a Letter of Intent."
msgstr ""
"Tout le monde peut candidater directement. La nomination constitue une voie supplémentaire : les personnes nommées qui remplissent les critères d’éligibilité seront contactées et recevront les "
"informations nécessaires pour soumettre une lettre d’intention."

msgctxt "body.a11bfa04-7d08-450c-a168-403db154acb6"
msgid "Know someone who embodies this vision? Nominate them."
msgstr "Vous connaissez quelqu’un qui incarne cette vision ? Proposez sa candidature."

msgctxt "body.a11bfa04-7d08-450c-a168-403db154acb6"
msgid ""
"We're seeking nominations from our global community to identify the next generation of technology leaders. Whether they're rising star innovators ready to scale their impact or senior leaders ready "
"to pursue field-defining work, we want to hear about builders whose work is focused on better technology futures—powered by people, open by design, and fueled by imagination."
msgstr ""
"Nous invitons notre communauté internationale à nous proposer des candidatures afin d’identifier la prochaine génération de leaders technologiques. Qu’il s’agisse d’innovateurs prometteurs prêts à "
"étendre leur influence ou de dirigeants chevronnés prêts à mener des projets qui redéfiniront leur domaine, nous souhaitons découvrir des acteurs dont le travail vise à bâtir un avenir technologique"
" meilleur : un avenir porté par les personnes, ouvert par nature et alimenté par l’imagination."

msgctxt "body.a11bfa04-7d08-450c-a168-403db154acb6"
msgid "<b>Self-nominations are welcome.</b> We believe in the power of community recognition, but we also know that sometimes the best candidates are those bold enough to step forward themselves."
msgstr ""
"<b>Les auto-candidatures sont les bienvenues.</b> Nous croyons au pouvoir de la reconnaissance par la communauté, mais nous savons aussi que les meilleurs candidats sont parfois ceux qui osent se "
"lancer et présenter eux-mêmes leur candidature."

msgctxt "body.a11bfa04-7d08-450c-a168-403db154acb6"
msgid "Ready to nominate someone who's building the tech future we all deserve?"
msgstr "Prêt à proposer la candidature d’une personne qui contribue à construire l’avenir technologique que nous méritons tous"

msgctxt "body.afad71c8-632c-4bad-9640-29e22d604f46.label"
msgid "Submit your nomination"
msgstr "Soumettez votre candidature"

msgctxt "body.642125e8-d4e1-4db6-9c11-8c825d44be94"
msgid "<i>Questions? Review</i> <a id=\"a1\"><i>our frequently asked questions</i></a><i> or contact</i> <a id=\"a2\"><i>fellowships@mozillafoundation.org</i></a><i>.</i>"
msgstr ""
